  density: the span of tensor test functions is dense in joint Schwartz space
  for each arity.>|<cell|139>|<cell|\U>|<cell|certain>>|<row|<cell|<hlink|C26|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/Work/C26.lean>>|<cell|V>|<cell|Boundary
