  action.>|<cell|408>|<cell|\U>|<cell|tentative>>|<row|<cell|<hlink|F05|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028/blob/3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464/YM/Work/F05.lean>>|<cell|III>|<cell|The
  critical value and Hessian agree between two gauge-fixing trees up to a
  chart ratio factor (<verbatim|Critical>, <verbatim|PriceGap>), so station
